<section>
    <h2>Items to Bring</h2>
    <p>Unlike the other convergences, Nexus of Eternity does not use demon slaying sigils or potions.</p>
    <ul class="itemul">
        <li>
            <h4>
                <img src="https://render.guildwars2.com/file/CFDC642093029E790C03381D73C703BDFFA9CDFF/499391.png" alt="sigil of night"  />
                <a href="https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Superior_Sigil_of_Force">Superior Sigil of Night</a>
            </h4>
            <p>
                3% Strike Damage, +7% Strike Damage at night. Totals to 10% Strike Damage. The Nexus of Eternity Convergence is always at night, so this is always at the full 10%.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <h4>
                <img src="https://render.guildwars2.com/file/77AAE10D3E03036D6E00642DEF01E5DF3468524F/220673.png" alt="sigil of bloodlust"  />
                <a href="https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Sigil#Stacking_bonus" target="_blank">Stacking Sigils</a>
            </h4>
            <p>
                Easily stackable during the pre phase, stacking sigils boost your chosen stat for each enemy you kill (as long as you don't go down).
            </p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</section>


